# Graph-Works Workspace

> **Workspace path:** `{{WORKSPACE_PATH}}`
> **Initialized:** `{{INITIALIZED_AT}}`

This is a graph-works workspace: a per-repo container for the knowledge graph, its
config, and its work tracker. `okf/` is the OKF bundle (the content itself); `_gw/`
holds everything graph-works owns about it.

## Layout

- `workspace.yaml` — the workspace manifest. Layout overrides, roles, and the seeded
  relay tail live here.
- `okf/` — the OKF bundle: `index.md`, `log.md`, and the concept/entity/work pages the
  installed verticals write.
- `_gw/_config/` — declarations the installed verticals own (schemas, sections, tags).
- `_gw/_cache/` — the derived code graph and traces. Gitignored.
- `_gw/worktrees/` — feature-work worktrees created under this workspace. Gitignored.
- `_gw/_repositories.yaml` — the scanned repositories, seeded from the layout at init.

